OL,3,GNEWSAStudent survey helps ex-mine
OL,4,Abecome nature reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former colliery site, where college
OL,7,Fstudents found "a rich mosaic of
OL,8,Fhabitats", will become a nature
OL,9,Freserve.
OL,11,FDurham County Council agreed to
OL,12,Fdelegate powers to Shincliffe Parish
OL,13,FCouncil to create the reserve at
OL,14,FShincliffe Pit Heaps.
OL,16,FThe mine closed in 1886 and in 2025
OL,17,FDarlington College students found the
OL,18,Fsite had turned into a "biodiverse
OL,19,Fgreen space" with a range of wildlife,
OL,20,Fincluding songbirds, wildflowers and
OL,21,Fthe increasingly rare Dingy Skipper
OL,22,Fbutterfly.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
